    "detailed_description": "\u201cRe Painter\u201d is a short, top-down action game<br />\r\nwhere your drawings become your special attacks.<br />\r\nCome up with your very own \u201cUltimate Move\u201d to defeat your enemies.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nThe main character is an unemployed artist with no redeemable talent.<br />\r\nWhat\u2019s worse, no one has ever recognized or complimented her art.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a world where \u201cHandsome Characters\u201d, \u201cRealistic Sceneries\u201d, \u201cSexy Ladies\u201d are embraced with open arms and treated as \u201cart\u201d,<br />\r\nmost artists start to question their existence.<br />\r\nBut instead of doing so, the main character decides to take her frustration out on the 4 grandmasters of art...<br />\r\nthe \u201cKAMIESHI\u201d.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nIt\u2019s up to you to help her out.<br />\r\nWe\u2019ve prepared drawing tools for the player.<br />\r\nSo even if you don\u2019t have an artistic bone in your body, you\u2019ll be able to draw some interesting patterns.<br />\r\nIf you\u2019re confident in your drawing skills, you can try drawing freehand as well.",
    "about_the_game": "\u201cRe Painter\u201d is a short, top-down action game<br />\r\nwhere your drawings become your special attacks.<br />\r\nCome up with your very own \u201cUltimate Move\u201d to defeat your enemies.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nThe main character is an unemployed artist with no redeemable talent.<br />\r\nWhat\u2019s worse, no one has ever recognized or complimented her art.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a world where \u201cHandsome Characters\u201d, \u201cRealistic Sceneries\u201d, \u201cSexy Ladies\u201d are embraced with open arms and treated as \u201cart\u201d,<br />\r\nmost artists start to question their existence.<br />\r\nBut instead of doing so, the main character decides to take her frustration out on the 4 grandmasters of art...<br />\r\nthe \u201cKAMIESHI\u201d.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nIt\u2019s up to you to help her out.<br />\r\nWe\u2019ve prepared drawing tools for the player.<br />\r\nSo even if you don\u2019t have an artistic bone in your body, you\u2019ll be able to draw some interesting patterns.<br />\r\nIf you\u2019re confident in your drawing skills, you can try drawing freehand as well.",
